# Local: Neon branch `development` (direct, no -pooler) so `prisma db push` / seed work.
# Do NOT point local at Neon `main` (production). See DEPLOY.md — only 2 DBs total.
# Vercel Preview: same Neon `development`, pooled + pgbouncer. Production: Neon `main` pooled.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@localhost:5432/rocha_cotizador?schema=public"
# Neon local / development branch (direct):
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@ep-noisy-darkness-a6ms81wq.us-west-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require"
# Neon Vercel Preview (pooled, development branch):
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@ep-noisy-darkness-a6ms81wq-pooler.us-west-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require&pgbouncer=true&connection_limit=1"
AUTH_SECRET="generate-with-openssl-rand-base64-32"
AUTH_URL="http://localhost:3000"
# Production: https://rocha-cotizador.vercel.app
# Optional seed-only password override (default in prisma/seed.ts: admin1234).
# Admin email is hardcoded in seed as admin@rocha.com — not an env var.
# ADMIN_PASSWORD="admin1234"
